</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Slap and tong.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e0/Slap_and_tong..png/revision/latest?cb=20210423021958\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Slap and tong.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e0/Slap_and_tong..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210423021958\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e0/Slap_and_tong..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210423021958 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/e0/Slap_and_tong..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210423021958 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Slap and tong.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Slap_and_tong..png\" data-image-name=\"Slap and tong..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_11\" title=\"Series 11\">11</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Ritchie\" title=\"Charlotte Ritchie\">Charlotte Ritchie</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Premature_conker.\" title=\"Premature conker.\">Premature conker.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_casserole.\" title=\"Absolute casserole.\">Absolute casserole.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Slap and tong.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_11\" title=\"Series 11\">Series 11</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 15 April 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Ritchie\" title=\"Charlotte Ritchie\">Charlotte Ritchie</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Slap_and_tong.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Slap and tong\" was the phrase adopted by <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> to initiate each round of the game played in the <a href=\"/wiki/Grab_the_marshmallow_with_your_tongs\" title=\"Grab the marshmallow with your tongs\">Grab the marshmallow with your tongs</a> task. The title card is honey in a hexagonal jar. The honey is in reference to <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_uniform_for_this_bee\" title=\"Make the best uniform for this bee\">Make the best uniform for this bee</a>, and the jar may be a reference to <a href=\"/wiki/Arrange_the_seven_objects_in_a_line_on_the_table_in_order_of_how_many_sides_they_have\" title=\"Arrange the seven objects in a line on the table in order of how many sides they have\">Arrange the seven objects in a line on the table in order of how many sides they have</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Slap_and_tong.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Smæk og tang', which translates as 'Slap and tong'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Pihdit ojoon', which translates as 'Tongs outstretched'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Den lilla tejpjungfrun', which translates as 'The little tape-mermaid'. This is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_on_the_captain%27s_hat\" title=\"Put on the captain&#39;s hat\">Put on the captain's hat</a> task. Note: In <a href=\"/wiki/Cover_your_legs_in_cling_film_and_duct_tape_/_Pose_as_The_Little_Mermaid_(B%C3%A4st_i_Test)\" title=\"Cover your legs in cling film and duct tape / Pose as The Little Mermaid (Bäst i Test)\">Bäst i Test's adaptation of this task</a>, the second part of the task instructs the contestants to recreate Den lille Havfrue (The Little Mermaid), a bronze statue of a mermaid in Copenhagen, Denmark.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Klask og klyp', which translates as 'Slap and tong'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Slap_and_tong.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Ritchie\" title=\"Charlotte Ritchie\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Charlotte Ritchie</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jamali_Maddix\" title=\"Jamali Maddix\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jamali Maddix</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lee_Mack\" title=\"Lee Mack\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lee Mack</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Wozniak\" title=\"Mike Wozniak\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mike Wozniak</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Kendall\" title=\"Sarah Kendall\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sarah Kendall</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_you_can_operate_with_your_hand\" title=\"Best thing you can operate with your hand\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing you can operate with your hand.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Put_on_the_captain%27s_hat\" title=\"Put on the captain&#39;s hat\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Cover your lower half in biodegradable clingfilm and gaffer tape so that no part of your lower half isn't covered in biodegradable cling film and gaffer tape.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Put on the captain's hat. Your lower half must be completely covered in biodegradable cling film and gaffer tape when wearing the captain's hat.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_uniform_for_this_bee\" title=\"Make the best uniform for this bee\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best uniform for this bee. You must wear your beekeeping outfit throughout the task.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Arrange_the_seven_objects_in_a_line_on_the_table_in_order_of_how_many_sides_they_have\" title=\"Arrange the seven objects in a line on the table in order of how many sides they have\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Arrange the seven objects in a line on the table in order of how many sides they have. Fewest side on the left, most sides on your right. You may only touch the objects with your face. If anything falls from the table, you are disqualified. You must put on your darkness goggles now.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grab_the_marshmallow_with_your_tongs\" title=\"Grab the marshmallow with your tongs\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Grab the marshmallow with your tongs. When the Taskmaster says \"play\", you have 10 seconds to grab the marshmallow. Once your tongs are over the table, you must attempt to grab the marshmallow. If you successfully grab the marshmallow, you win.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>4</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Bat away the marshmallow. When the Taskmaster says \"play\", you have 10 seconds to bat away the marshmallow. Your hand may not be over the table until the other player's tongs are over the table. If you bat away the marshmallow, you win.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>17</b>\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Slap_and_tong.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/slap-and-tong\"><i>Slap and tong.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70912-005\"><i>Slap and tong.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141507\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.096 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.150 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 662/1000000\nPost‐expa